# Ephemeral scratch for the checkpoint-template regression suite: per-run UUID
# directories holding extracted R blocks and fixture skill trees. Created in
# setUp and removed in tearDown; ignored so an interrupted run cannot leak into
# `git status`. Inside the repo (never /tmp) per CLAUDE.md § Scratch Files.
tests/python/_scratch_checkpoint_templates/